  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Human Resources Management"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Minor in Human Resources Management focuses on developing the broad set of knowledge and competencies expected of human resources professionals in organizations today. Students receive a solid overview as well as exposure to specialties within the field such as labour relations, recruitment and selection, managing diversity, compensation, organizational behaviour and training and development. Most of the courses in the Minor can also be used toward the Certified Human Resources Professional (CHRP) designation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: Ted Rogers School of Business Management, Human Resources and Organizational Behaviour Department"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions: This minor is not available to students in the following programs:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Business Management - Human Resources Management Major (regular and co-operative options)",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Business Management - Human Resources Management Major",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/trsm/business_mgt/human_resources_management_major/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Required courses (3):"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 405 Organizational Behaviour or HTH 601 Organizational Behaviour",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 405",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/405/"
        },
        {
          "text": "HTH 601",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/hospitality-and-tourism-management/HTH/601/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 520 Industrial Relations Foundations",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 520",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/520/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 523 Human Resources Management or HTH 503 Human Resources Management or CRI 700 Human Resources in Creative Industries",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 523",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/523/"
        },
        {
          "text": "HTH 503",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/hospitality-and-tourism-management/HTH/503/"
        },
        {
          "text": "CRI 700",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/creative-industries/CRI/700/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus three (3) of the following:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "LAW 529 Employment and Labour Law",
      "links": [
